<title>SINGAPORE: Jurong Eng sees better performance 1997.</title>
<headline>Jurong Eng sees better performance 1997.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jurong Engineering Ltd said on Friday it expected its performance to improve in 1997.</p>
<p>The company issued the statement with its 1996 financial results. It gave no other details.</p>
<p>It said its 1996 net profit rose 4.2 percent to Singapore $8.38 million.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
